The files in this directory are third-party vendored dependencies, bundled
verbatim and served as static assets:

  - xterm.js                 (xterm.js core)
  - xterm.css                (xterm.js stylesheet)
  - xterm-addon-fit.js       (@xterm/addon-fit)
  - xterm-addon-web-links.js (@xterm/addon-web-links)

They are distributed under the MIT License, reproduced below. See
https://github.com/xtermjs/xterm.js for the upstream project and full history.

